      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"AdditionalHealthEndpointPath.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.health.actuate.endpoint\"><code>AdditionalHealthEndpointPath</code></a> from the given\n<a href=\"../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a> and value.",
