      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns <code>true</code> if this path has the given <a href=\"../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果此路径具有给定的<a href=\"../../../actuate/endpoint/web/WebServerNamespace.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.web\"><code>WebServerNamespace</code></a>，则返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
