    {
      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"AdditionalHealthEndpointPath.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.health.actuate.endpoint\"><code>AdditionalHealthEndpointPath</code></a> from the given input. The input\nmust contain a prefix and value separated by a `:`. The value must be limited to\none path segment. For example, `server:/healthz`.",
